    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Est-ce que vous poss\xE9dez votre propre mouchoir\u202F?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: Oui, comme tout le monde de nos jours.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f7dea1d319d6cb4583762e0d0da2cc2, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Mais pas d\u2019une telle qualit\xE9, celui-ci doit valoir une fortune
      en vu de son motif."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f7dea1d319d6cb4583762e0d0da2cc2, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: Tissue
    testimony: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 87d03cc5ad5636046b9b537ae574033b, type: 2}
